{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >IIn Undusted: Letters from the Past, you are tasked with cleaning items that have fallen into disrepair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dust, scrub, and polish your way through the chapters to learn the personal backstory behind each item.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891020/extras/7ff224faa6d3815ed48e38b24d56f20d.avif?t=1761872202\" width=610 height=342 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adora returns home after her mother's passing.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > She starts to clean long-neglected items inside her family home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > As those items are restored to their original conditions, they start whispering memories of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > As Adora cleans, she discovers a myriad of forgotten stories, some hidden away. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > What kind of stories will she experience? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Virtual ASMR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891020/extras/1d532b28364af3422e028ece0522c019.poster.avif?t=1761872202\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891020/extras/1d532b28364af3422e028ece0522c019.webm?t=1761872202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891020/extras/1d532b28364af3422e028ece0522c019.mp4?t=1761872202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience carefully crafted sound effects that capture the essence of each tool you use. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each chapter's ambient audio will wholly immerse you in the game! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Touching Story<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891020/extras/2f5de4d3097c532de21ab28928d577e7.poster.avif?t=1761872202\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891020/extras/2f5de4d3097c532de21ab28928d577e7.webm?t=1761872202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891020/extras/2f5de4d3097c532de21ab28928d577e7.mp4?t=1761872202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Recall the memories associated with each item.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > When did Adora and her mother's relationship start to fall apart? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Will she be able to finally understand her mother after her passing? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Charming Art Style<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891020/extras/f90217caa005e01505d014a7cc2ebe40.poster.avif?t=1761872202\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891020/extras/f90217caa005e01505d014a7cc2ebe40.webm?t=1761872202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891020/extras/f90217caa005e01505d014a7cc2ebe40.mp4?t=1761872202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Appreciate a captivating art style that is uniquely expressed through pixelated textures.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Experience a heartfelt and emotional story about family. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Forget about time limits and failure\u2014just relax and enjoy! The items won't break like they would in real life! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Admire beautiful artwork that charmingly portrays Adora's story. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Listen to original background music that complements the relaxing gameplay. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the oddly satisfying feeling from ASMR and restoration videos, but in a game!  </p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A Dusted Key","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2891020/0044de3c8cbd2691311ff13bc9510850f7c3aacd.jpg"},{"name":"Bunny Ears!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2891020/bd511734d387f203ea2cd8cc9a13521254412f47.jpg"},{"name":"Shattered","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2891020/d8c181282e49dfd566a828c8d77de8b64b6f9370.jpg"},{"name":"Shining in the Darkness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2891020/d5e607800127cf325b9777ff7e302fcfff28664a.jpg"},{"name":"A Little Ditty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2891020/da4689c929539c91aceb42d91145dc652dc5e6e1.jpg"},{"name":"No Means No","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2891020/f2811ac4bc23534d02a2e71cc5c297c6d93c7e3a.jpg"},{"name":"Snow-capped","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2891020/b1a00aa4cf7e653dbb746e597af66e0c31dcc52b.jpg"},{"name":"Left Behind","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2891020/b7d22fcaa74baf6323cb19d48537d26f54cec4a8.jpg"},{"name":"In Darkness Found","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2891020/40fd01326a8a641b51163e5d1ed633ce904732a2.jpg"},{"name":"Words Gone Astray","pa