\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > As Adora cleans, she discovers a myriad of forgotten stories, some hidden away. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > What kind of stories will she experience? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Virtual ASMR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891020/extras/1d532b28364af3422e028ece0522c019.poster.avif?t=1761872202\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891020/extras/1d532b28364af3422e028ece0522c019.webm?t=1761872202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891020/extras/1d532b28364af3422e028ece0522c019.mp4?t=1761872202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience carefully crafted sound effects that capture the essence of each tool you use. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each chapter's ambient audio will wholly immerse you in the game! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Touching Story<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891020/extras/2f5de4d3097c532de21ab28928d577e7.poster.avif?t=1761872202\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891020/extras/2f5de4d3097c532de21ab28928d577e7.webm?t=1761872202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891020/extras/2f5de4d3097c532de21ab28928d577e7.mp4?t=1761872202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Recall the memories associated with each item.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > When did Adora and her mother's relationship start to fall apart? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Will she be able to finally understand her mother after her passing? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Charming Art Style<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891020/extras/f90217caa005e01505d014a7cc2ebe40.poster.avif?t=1761872202\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891020/extras/f90217caa005e01505d014a7cc2ebe40.webm?t=1761872202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891020/extras/f90217caa005e01505d014a7cc2ebe40.mp4?t=1761872202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Appreciate a captivating art style that is uniquely expressed through pixelated textures.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Experience a heartfelt and emotional story about family. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Forget about time limits and failure\u2014just relax and enjoy! The items won't break like they would in real life! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Admire beautiful artwork that charmingly portrays Adora's story. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Listen to original background music that complements the relaxing gameplay. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the oddly satisfying feeling from ASMR and restoration videos, but in a game!  </p></li></ul>","developers":["5minlab Corp."],"dlc":[3904790,3867560],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891020/fc576b345b2552758883bcb0940d95ad2e3e322e/header.jpg?t=1761872202","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92025 5minlab Corp. Published by Toge Productions. All rights